    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Mercy Igoki, the Registrar at Aga Khan University in Kenya is more than just an administrative figure. She is a mentor, a counselor, and a passionate educator who has dedicated her career to guiding students towards their academic and professional goals.",
